  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "strike the highest-energy enemy, dealing damage and reducing their energy",
    "skill1": "dash to closest symmetrical enemy at battle start, dealing damage",
    "skill2": "normal attacks replaced by rapid strikes briefly at battle start",
    "skill3": "battle crit increase",
    "skill4": "gain a shield at battle start",
    "skill5": "rapid attack hits also reduce target vitality"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Silvina]] opens by **dashing to the closest symmetrical enemy**, landing burst before normal pacing resumes. A brief rapid-strike state and battle-start shield help the opener survive its first exchange. Her ultimate targets the **highest-Energy enemy**, draining that target's Energy before a cast can land. Crit growth and Vitality reduction on rapid hits improve follow-up kills. She shines as an opening assassin against predictable formations, but loses value when no symmetrical target is available or the first dash cannot reach a priority unit.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Silvina]] flashes to a symmetrical target at battle start, then her ultimate seeks the highest-Energy enemy and drains its cast. Break the symmetrical setup and avoid storing Energy on an exposed backliner. Delete this melee opener early with high-damage melee like [[Himmel]] or [[Zandrok]], interrupt the ultimate with [[Lily May]], and inhibit the threatened caster with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]] or [[Evie]]."
}
